+|---|---|
+| `python -m py_compile reverse_agent\project_state.py` | passed |
+| `python -m pytest -q tests\test_project_state.py` | `57 passed in 5.11s` |
+| `python -m reverse_agent.project_state build --reports-dir solve_reports --sample samplereverse --run-name sr_lhs_last_writer_health_fix_20260518_r3` | passed; generated `round_20260519_063549` / `state_20260519_063549_cf4670d47eb6` |
+| `python -m reverse_agent.project_state status` | passed; reports `decision_status: UNKNOWN`, `report_status: SUCCESS`, `report_id: report_phase1b_fix_20260519` |
+| `python -m reverse_agent.project_state archive-round` | passed; wrote `project_state/rounds/round_20260519_063549/round_manifest.json` |
+
+### State Notes
+
+- `project_state/task_packet.json` no longer stores a full `handoff_status` snapshot.
+- `status_summary()` remains the authoritative place to inspect current decision/report status.
